{"seq":1,"slug":"logit-masking-fsm","title":"logit 掩码与有限状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/mechanisms/logit-masking-fsm","wordCount":1500,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"logit-掩码与有限状态机\">logit 掩码与有限状态机</h1><p>约束解码里最高效、也最该先掌握的一类，是能用正则表达式描述的约束。它的妙处在于：正则可以离线编译成一个状态有限的机器，运行时维护&quot;当前在哪个状态&quot;几乎不要钱，而每个状态允许哪些 token 可以提前算好缓存。这一篇把&quot;正则→FSM→token 掩码&quot;这条链路拆到底，它是 Outlines 早期方案的核心，也是理解一切约束机制的支点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>能用正则描述的约束是约束解码里最高效的一类：正则离线编译成状态有限的机器，运行时只需记住&quot;当前在哪个状态&quot;，每个状态的合法 token 集合还能提前算好缓存。这条&quot;正则 → FSM → token 掩码&quot;链路是理解一切约束机制的支点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[&quot;正则表达式&quot;] --&gt;|机械转换| D[&quot;确定性有限状态机 DFA&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; P[&quot;对每个状态 q&lt;br/&gt;离线预计算合法 token 集 M(q)&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; B[&quot;缓存成位图&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; O[&quot;运行时:掩码 = 一次查表&lt;br/&gt;开销与词表无关&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; L[&quot;能力上界:只识别正则语言&lt;br/&gt;无法保证任意深括号配对&quot;]\">graph TD\n    R[\"正则表达式\"] --&gt;|机械转换| D[\"确定性有限状态机 DFA\"]\n    D --&gt; P[\"对每个状态 q&lt;br/&gt;离线预计算合法 token 集 M(q)\"]\n    P --&gt; B[\"缓存成位图\"]\n    B --&gt; O[\"运行时:掩码 = 一次查表&lt;br/&gt;开销与词表无关\"]\n    D --&gt; L[\"能力上界:只识别正则语言&lt;br/&gt;无法保证任意深括号配对\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>DFA 是五元组</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(Q, \\Sigma, \\delta, q_0, F)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，确定性意味着任意状态读到任意字符，下一状态唯一。</li>\n<li><strong>核心翻译</strong>：token <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 在状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 合法，当且仅当从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 逐字符走 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 能走完整串不卡壳。</li>\n<li><strong>可预计算</strong>：合法集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 只依赖状态，离线遍历状态 × token 存成位图，运行时算掩码退化为查表。</li>\n<li><strong>预计算有代价</strong>：朴素索引是&quot;状态数 × 词表&quot;的完整矩阵，需稀疏化/token 上下文无关分类压缩。</li>\n<li><strong>硬边界</strong>：FSM 只识别正则语言，JSON 的任意深嵌套必须交给文法层，实践是 FSM 管局部、栈管递归的混合策略。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"从正则到确定性有限状态机\">从正则到确定性有限状态机</h2><p>一个正则表达式可以机械地转换成确定性有限状态机（DFA）。DFA 是一个五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(Q, \\Sigma, \\delta, q_0, F)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：状态集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>、字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span>、转移函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta: Q \\times \\Sigma \\to Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>、起始状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、接受状态集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>。它的关键性质是&quot;确定性&quot;——在任意状态读到任意字符，下一个状态唯一确定。</p>\n<p>以约束一个简单布尔值 <code>true</code> 或 <code>false</code> 为例，DFA 长这样：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    q0[q0 起始] --&gt;|t| q1[q1]&#10;    q0 --&gt;|f| q5[q5]&#10;    q1 --&gt;|r| q2[q2]&#10;    q2 --&gt;|u| q3[q3]&#10;    q3 --&gt;|e| q4[q4 接受]&#10;    q5 --&gt;|a| q6[q6]&#10;    q6 --&gt;|l| q7[q7]&#10;    q7 --&gt;|s| q8[q8]&#10;    q8 --&gt;|e| q9[q9 接受]\">flowchart TD\n    q0[q0 起始] --&gt;|t| q1[q1]\n    q0 --&gt;|f| q5[q5]\n    q1 --&gt;|r| q2[q2]\n    q2 --&gt;|u| q3[q3]\n    q3 --&gt;|e| q4[q4 接受]\n    q5 --&gt;|a| q6[q6]\n    q6 --&gt;|l| q7[q7]\n    q7 --&gt;|s| q8[q8]\n    q8 --&gt;|e| q9[q9 接受]</pre><p>生成时约束器只需记住&quot;我现在在 q2&quot;，就知道下一个字符只能是 <code>u</code>。这个&quot;当前状态&quot;就是上一篇 <a href=\"../foundations/constrained-decoding-basics\">约束解码基础</a> 说的约束器记忆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"字符级转移到-token-级掩码的翻译\">字符级转移到 token 级掩码的翻译</h2><p>DFA 的转移定义在字符上，但模型采样在 token 上，这正是要跨越的鸿沟。核心算法是：对每个状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 和词表里每个 token <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>（它是一串字符 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_1 c_2 \\dots c_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），判断从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 出发逐字符走 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 能否一路不卡壳。形式化地，定义状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 下 token <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 合法当且仅当存在一条转移链：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>δ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊥</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>其中</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msup><mi>δ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>…</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta^*(q, t) \\ne \\bot \\quad \\text{其中} \\quad \\delta^*(q, c_1 c_2 \\dots c_k) = \\delta(\\dots \\delta(\\delta(q, c_1), c_2) \\dots, c_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其中</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把每个状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 下所有合法 token 的集合记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M(q) \\subseteq V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，掩码就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的指示向量。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 只依赖状态，可以<strong>离线预计算</strong>：遍历所有状态 × 所有 token，结果存成位图。运行时算掩码退化成一次查表，开销与词表大小无关——这就是为什么 FSM 路线能做到&quot;约束几乎零成本&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预计算的代价与索引结构\">预计算的代价与索引结构</h2><p>预计算不是没有代价的。下表列出关键量级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>典型规模</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>词表大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert V\\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>万</mtext><mo>∼</mo><mn>25</mn><mtext>万</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{万}\\sim 25\\text{万}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>现代 LLM tokenizer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DFA 状态数</td>\n<td>几十到上万</td>\n<td>随正则复杂度增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>朴素索引大小</td>\n<td>状态数 × <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert V\\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 位</td>\n<td>完整 token-state 矩阵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单状态掩码计算</td>\n<td>约 50μs（128k 词表，单核）</td>\n<td>据 llguidance 实测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>朴素地存&quot;状态数 × 词表&quot;的完整矩阵在复杂正则下会爆内存，所以工程上用稀疏结构、状态合并、或在 token 字典树（trie）上做转移来压缩。XGrammar 进一步引入了&quot;上下文无关 token&quot;的概念——大量 token 的合法性与栈状态无关，可以预先批量判定，把运行时要现算的部分压到极小。这些优化的横向对比见 <a href=\"../systems/library-landscape\">库与引擎格局</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"正则的能力上界\">正则的能力上界</h2><p>FSM 路线的优雅有个硬边界：它只能识别正则语言。这意味着它能约束枚举值、固定格式（日期、UUID、电话号）、定长字段，但<strong>无法保证任意深度的括号配对</strong>。原因是配对需要&quot;记住已经开了多少个括号再闭合多少个&quot;，而 DFA 的状态是有限的，数不了无限深的嵌套。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[约束需求] --&gt; B{需要递归/&lt;br/&gt;配对嵌套吗?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否: 枚举/定长/&lt;br/&gt;固定格式| C[FSM 足够&lt;br/&gt;本篇]&#10;    B --&gt;|是: 任意层&lt;br/&gt;JSON 嵌套| D[超出正则&lt;br/&gt;需 PDA/Earley&lt;br/&gt;见 2/2]&#10;    C --&gt; E[预计算掩码&lt;br/&gt;运行时近零成本]&#10;    D --&gt; F[运行时维护栈&lt;br/&gt;开销略高]\">flowchart TD\n    A[约束需求] --&gt; B{需要递归/&lt;br/&gt;配对嵌套吗?}\n    B --&gt;|否: 枚举/定长/&lt;br/&gt;固定格式| C[FSM 足够&lt;br/&gt;本篇]\n    B --&gt;|是: 任意层&lt;br/&gt;JSON 嵌套| D[超出正则&lt;br/&gt;需 PDA/Earley&lt;br/&gt;见 2/2]\n    C --&gt; E[预计算掩码&lt;br/&gt;运行时近零成本]\n    D --&gt; F[运行时维护栈&lt;br/&gt;开销略高]</pre><p>所以一个完整 JSON 约束器不可能纯靠 FSM。但有意思的是，实际系统里 FSM 仍承担了大部分工作量：JSON 里绝大多数局部（一个字符串值、一个数字、一个枚举）都是正则语言，只有&quot;结构骨架&quot;（对象/数组的嵌套）才需要上文法。混合策略——用 FSM 处理 token 级局部、用栈处理结构递归——是高性能引擎的通用做法，下一篇 <a href=\"cfg-grammar-constraints\">上下文无关文法约束</a> 展开这个组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>正则约束可机械编译成确定性有限状态机 DFA，运行时只需维护当前状态。</li>\n<li>核心算法是把字符级转移翻译成 token 级合法集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，它只依赖状态，故可离线预计算成位图。</li>\n<li>预计算让运行时算掩码退化为查表，约束开销几乎与词表无关，但索引内存需用稀疏化/token 上下文无关分类压缩。</li>\n<li>硬边界：FSM 只识别正则语言，无法保证任意深度括号配对，故 JSON 必须配合文法层。</li>\n<li>实践是混合策略：FSM 管 token 级局部，栈管结构递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>突破正则上限的机制：<a href=\"cfg-grammar-constraints\">上下文无关文法约束</a></li>\n<li>掩码在采样循环里的位置：<a href=\"../foundations/constrained-decoding-basics\">约束解码基础</a></li>\n<li>各库对预计算/索引的不同取舍：<a href=\"../systems/library-landscape\">库与引擎格局</a></li>\n<li>跨库：正则、有限自动机的形式语言基础也用于词法分析，见 <a href=\"../../natural-language-processing/\">自然语言处理 · 分词与词法</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"logit 掩码与有限状态机","id":"logit-掩码与有限状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从正则到确定性有限状态机","id":"从正则到确定性有限状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"字符级转移到 token 级掩码的翻译","id":"字符级转移到-token-级掩码的翻译"},{"level":2,"text":"预计算的代价与索引结构","id":"预计算的代价与索引结构"},{"level":2,"text":"正则的能力上界","id":"正则的能力上界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"语法与模式两条路线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/foundations/grammar-vs-schema"},"next":{"title":"上下文无关文法约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/mechanisms/cfg-grammar-constraints"}}